     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Now, historians think this is almost certainly a legend, maybe inspired by a picture on his tomb, but it's way too good to leave off the list."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Bonus fact: the epitaph said to be on his grave doesn't mention a single one of his plays, only that he fought at Marathon. Priorities."
  },
  {
   "hold": 2.5,
   "show": {
