   }
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "He invaded Gaul and Italy, and he made the Eastern Romans pay him huge amounts of gold just to leave them alone."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "So how does the most feared man in Europe finally go down?"
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "In 453, Attila threw a massive feast to celebrate his wedding to a young woman named Ildico.",
   "show": {
    "k": "scene",
    "bg": "camp",
    "cast": [
     {
      "id": "attila",
      "x": 0.35,
      "pose": "cheer",
