     },
     {
      "text": "IRON",
      "at": 2.4,
      "color": "#3A3A3A"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Within a couple of years, his sons were fighting over his empire, and the whole thing fell apart."
  },
