  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Either way, the old emperor ended up in the water, and he drowned."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "His soldiers tried to carry his body on to the Holy Land, but he ended up buried in several different places along the way, and nobody knows where his bones are today."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Without him, most of his army simply turned around and went home, and the German part of the crusade fell apart.",
